 |\n|  | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |  |" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355761 1113 #uuid "523ef76a-97be-5fae-a5a2-7a0a3a7ab633" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355761 1145 "We can write $T(v)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(v) & =[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -9\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $T(v)=\\frac{3}{4}v,$ and so the linear transformation $T$ is a dilation with scale factor $k=\\frac{3}{4}.$\n\nThe matrix that represents a dilation of scale factor $k$ is given by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 0 \\\\ 0 & k\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the standard matrix of $T$ is\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{4} & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{3}{4}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355762 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355763 13194139535574 true] [17592186355762 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535574 true] [17592186355762 1041 "field-1" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355762 1104 #edb/ref 17592186355763 13194139535574 true] [17592186355762 1110 #uuid "9ca17642-df95-5348-9786-1af88c156abb" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355763 1034 "\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355763 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535574 true] [17592186355763 1111 #uuid "322897b3-c50d-5f65-a505-ff966228b9f1" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355764 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355765 13194139535574 true] [17592186355764 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535574 true] [17592186355764 1041 "field-2" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355764 1104 #edb/ref 17592186355765 13194139535574 true] [17592186355764 1110 #uuid "fff3f68e-cdfd-5cd0-888b-6ba35b5d1b6e" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355765 1034 "0" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355765 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535574 true] [17592186355765 1111 #uuid "9f165755-9fc6-5754-b41e-d81bad52353a" 13194139535574 true] [17592186355766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186355767 13194139535574 true] [17592186355766 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 1319413